item.description:
In this clip, Steve Eisenhower explains what he believes is the theological reason behind centuries of Christian efforts to convert Jews. According to Steve, a New Testament passage is understood by many Christians to mean that Jesus cannot return until the Jewish people accept him.

We also discuss Messianic Judaism, missionary outreach to Jewish communities, and why this issue continues to matter today.

@RabbiAronSokol 
@theexodusproject6212 


#judaism  #christianity  #Jesus #messianicjudaism  #bible  #Torah

